Package: uboot-lenovo-asphalt
Version: 2026.10~rc5
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Fauzan
Section: admin
Description: U-Boot Android boot image for Lenovo Asphalt (TB320FC)
 This package only installs the validated boot image. It does not flash device
 firmware; install the image to boot_b using the checked ABL fastboot workflow.
